/* Tfa140 - ShapeFix_Face.FixLoopWire wire-with-self-intersection
 * A rectangular face with an inner wire that self-intersects (figure-8 topology).
 * FixLoopWire's loop-merge logic produces a non-manifold output instead of rejecting/fixing.
 */
