/* === Inner loop: self-intersecting figure-8 wire ===
 * Forms an "8" shape that crosses itself at (5,4)
 * Path: (2,2) -> (5,2) -> (8,2) -> (8,6) -> (5,6) -> (8,6) -> (2,6) -> (5,2) -> back to (2,2)
 * This creates a figure-8 topology where the path crosses itself.
 */
